---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { graph } from '../lib/patterns.js';
const cardsBg = graph({ parity: 0, seed: 6, cx: 800, cy: 450, satellites: 110, hubs: 9 });
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="Work" description="Selected work: a cloud migration, an AI tooling change, a SaaS product built from nothing, a small-business site, and a personal knowledge system run by agents.">
  <Hero variant="graph" seed={5} eyebrow="Work" title="Proof, not promises.">
    <p class="lede">Here are a few things I have built or led. LinkedIn names the employers and clients; this page names only the work and the result.</p>
  </Hero>

  <section class="section band-parallax">
    <div class="band-bg" data-parallax="0.55" set:html={cardsBg} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Platform migration</p>
          <h3>Every service on a finance platform moved to a new cloud</h3>
          <p>I led the move of every service on a live platform to a new cloud. Compute costs fell; capacity and uptime rose. Nobody outside engineering noticed, which was the point.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">AI adoption</p>
          <h3>65% more tickets closed per sprint</h3>
          <p>I chose the AI tooling for an engineering team: which tools, where in the workflow, and what conventions. The team's own tracker measured the change, before and after.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">New SaaS product</p>
          <h3>A full-stack product from an empty repo</h3>
          <p>I built it in MongoDB, Nest, Angular, and Node, with the Docker, Kubernetes, and Jenkins pipeline to ship it. I designed it with the product team, not from a handoff.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Small business</p>
          <h3><a href="https://flourishfinancialgroup.org">Flourish Financial Group</a></h3>
          <p>A financial counselor's site, live about a month after the first conversation. It is static and fast, costs $0 a month to host, and sits in her own GitHub account with a written guide, so she runs it herself.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">AI systems</p>
          <h3>A second brain that runs itself</h3>
          <p>Agents sort my email, texts, scans, and notes into an Obsidian vault on a schedule, and one dashboard shows what needs me. It is the working prototype for the knowledge-assistant offer. A case study is coming.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Healthtech</p>
          <h3>Video interpreting for hospitals</h3>
          <p>I maintained the video portal hospital staff use to reach interpreters, and I built the permissions and queue-assignment app behind it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
